        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snow_Shoe%2C_Pennsylvania"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1840, Snow Shoe Township was carved out of Boggs Township, marking its official establishment.",
