      ],
      "source": "https://centre.pagenweb.org/twpsboros/snowtwp1.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "John Bechdol became the first permanent settler in Snow Shoe in May 1818, laying the town’s early foundations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
